  "description": "The crazy antics in a mansion where only male butlers are employed!!\n\nArthur, a fastidious but professional candidate for the position of head butler, Ryan who only looks at Arthur, and Oliver, the youngest, who has bold ambitions...! Please watch the efforts of the 8 butlers, including these three, who have strong personalities and charms, as they serve their master.\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: The title is a portmanteau of the Korean words for \"butler\" (집사) and \"love\" (사랑).*",
